   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Two rayitas and a little circular.",
   "texto": [
    "Con dos rayitas (゛) arriba a la derecha, la consonante se vuelve **sonora**: か ka → **が ga**, さ sa → **ざ za**, た ta → **だ da**, は ha → **ば ba**.",
    "With a circular (∞), the row h becomes **p**: ∞ ha → **ぱ pa**.",
    "Exceptions: **じ** is said to be «ji» (as the English j of «jeans») and **づ**, almost unused, «zu»."
   ]
